        "text": "Security update for helm",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for helm fixes the following issues\n\n- Update to version 3.21.3\n- CVE-2026-39821: golang.org/x/net/idna: failure to reject ASCII-only Punycode-encoded labels allows for validation bypass and privilege escalation (bsc#1266598).\n- CVE-2026-56852: golang.org/x/text/unicode/norm: infinite loop on truncated/invalid UTF-8 input (bsc#1271997).\n",
